## check: 003_eam_alloy.incritic -a1e-6
## delete: 003_eam_alloy.cro
## labels: regression quick nodata

# Cu-Ni with unequal numbers of the two species, so that the copper and
# nickel environments differ and the minimum is not fixed by symmetry. This
# exercises the (i,j) pair-table indexing of a setfl file: confusing the
# Cu-Cu, Ni-Ni and Cu-Ni tables moves the minimum.
crystal
 cell 4.40 4.40 4.40 90 90 90 angstrom
 spg 1
 neq 0.2000 0.2000 0.2000 Ni
 neq 0.2000 0.7000 0.7000 Ni
 neq 0.7000 0.2000 0.7000 Ni
 neq 0.7000 0.7000 0.2200 Cu
endcrystal
edit relax eam 1d-7
write 003_eam_alloy.incritic
